(7677704, 1255435, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It would have just a bit more impact for me if the ratio was a little wider which could have been easily accomplished by cropping the top a bit.  This would have also removed the dark distraction at the top edge.  Fun thinking for the theme however.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this.  It would have just a bit more impact for me if the ratio was a little wider which could have been easily accomplished by cropping the top a bit.  This would have also removed the dark distraction at the top edge.  Fun thinking for the theme however.  Good luck.', '2020-10-25 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677705, 1255558, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The tone mapping pushed the yellows a bit much in the sky, but overall a nice (wide) landscape.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this.  The tone mapping pushed the yellows a bit much in the sky, but overall a nice (wide) landscape.  Good luck.', '2020-10-25 10:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677706, 1255547, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s certainly ''Wide'' but I don''t feel any subject presence at all.  Sorry.</td>', 'It''s certainly ''Wide'' but I don''t feel any subject presence at all.  Sorry.', '2020-10-25 10:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677707, 1255461, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice, but it''s all in the crop.</td>', 'Nice, but it''s all in the crop.', '2020-10-25 10:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677708, 1255463, 30049, '<td valign="top">Iconic location.  Certainly fits ''Wide''.  Good luck.</td>', 'Iconic location.  Certainly fits ''Wide''.  Good luck.', '2020-10-25 10:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677709, 1255472, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice, but ''Wide'' is being achieved mostly in the crop.</td>', 'Nice, but ''Wide'' is being achieved mostly in the crop.', '2020-10-25 10:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677710, 1255529, 30049, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful disparity in lighting between the foreground and background.  Nicely seen and captured!  Good luck.</td>', 'What a wonderful disparity in lighting between the foreground and background.  Nicely seen and captured!  Good luck.', '2020-10-25 10:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677711, 1255196, 30049, '<td valign="top">A lot going on for sure and interesting to look at.  It''s a pretty thin crop to achieve the ''Wide'' aspect.</td>', 'A lot going on for sure and interesting to look at.  It''s a pretty thin crop to achieve the ''Wide'' aspect.', '2020-10-25 10:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677712, 1255538, 30049, '<td valign="top">... and WAY too much time at the feeder!  Wow.</td>', '... and WAY too much time at the feeder!  Wow.', '2020-10-25 10:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677713, 1255208, 30049, '<td valign="top">This challenge makes sense for a drone shot.  Love the fall colors.  The distant skyline didn''t cooperate much (would have been way cool to have a bit of drama there).</td>', 'This challenge makes sense for a drone shot.  Love the fall colors.  The distant skyline didn''t cooperate much (would have been way cool to have a bit of drama there).', '2020-10-25 11:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677714, 1255560, 30049, '<td valign="top">Bit narrow on the crop (panoramic in nature).  Too bad you couldn''t stop down some to get more starburst on the setting sun.  Nice colors however.  Good luck.</td>', 'Bit narrow on the crop (panoramic in nature).  Too bad you couldn''t stop down some to get more starburst on the setting sun.  Nice colors however.  Good luck.', '2020-10-25 11:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677715, 1255457, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why are so many images cropped to panoramic ratios in this challenge?  Yep, you definitely captured some fall color.  Good luck.</td>', 'Why are so many images cropped to panoramic ratios in this challenge?  Yep, you definitely captured some fall color.  Good luck.', '2020-10-25 11:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677716, 1255550, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like everything but what''s displayed on the TV.  :-)  On a serious note, this is a well thought out capture.  A slight perspective tweak in post to straighten up the side angles would have bumped this a point or two.  Still, nicely seen and captured.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like everything but what''s displayed on the TV.  :-)  On a serious note, this is a well thought out capture.  A slight perspective tweak in post to straighten up the side angles would have bumped this a point or two.  Still, nicely seen and captured.  Good luck!', '2020-10-25 11:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677717, 1255129, 30049, '<td valign="top">:-)  Curious creatures aren''t they?  Fun.  I almost did something similar.  Good luck!</td>', ':-)  Curious creatures aren''t they?  Fun.  I almost did something similar.  Good luck!', '2020-10-25 11:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
