(7678206, 1255471, 3306, '<td valign="top">I am interested in your technique. I am fascinated by the fact that you have such a sharp focus on the stars which required a fast shutter speed and yet there is light coming from either a sunrise or a town on the other side of the mountain. So what interests me is how you get both the light and dark so nicely exposed. Good job.</td>', 'I am interested in your technique. I am fascinated by the fact that you have such a sharp focus on the stars which required a fast shutter speed and yet there is light coming from either a sunrise or a town on the other side of the mountain. So what interests me is how you get both the light and dark so nicely exposed. Good job.', '2020-10-29 21:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7678207, 1255208, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and wonderful point of view. Is this a drone shot?</td>', 'Beautiful colors and wonderful point of view. Is this a drone shot?', '2020-10-29 21:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7678208, 1255461, 3306, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel like I am right down there in the water.</td>', 'Makes me feel like I am right down there in the water.', '2020-10-29 21:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7678209, 1255472, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Are the clouds on the right actually smoke coming from that apparent chimney? I like the way it blends into the mist.</td>', 'Very nice. Are the clouds on the right actually smoke coming from that apparent chimney? I like the way it blends into the mist.', '2020-10-29 21:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7678210, 1255529, 3306, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautifully serene place. I will be interested to see where it is. I like the way the dock adds interest to the scene.</td>', 'Looks like a beautifully serene place. I will be interested to see where it is. I like the way the dock adds interest to the scene.', '2020-10-29 21:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
