(7678212, 1255351, 3306, '<td valign="top">Been there done that!! Its interesting to see the opposite point of view. Kind of scary! Your hygienist is a good sport. Did she scrape all the plaque off your camera lens?</td>', 'Been there done that!! Its interesting to see the opposite point of view. Kind of scary! Your hygienist is a good sport. Did she scrape all the plaque off your camera lens?', '2020-10-29 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7678214, 1255550, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective. Didnt know what Quibi was so I looked it up. I guess nobody else heard of it either! I like the stars from your ceiling lights. Nice house! I like the way you display your pictures on the wall.</td>', 'Very cool perspective. Didnt know what Quibi was so I looked it up. I guess nobody else heard of it either! I like the stars from your ceiling lights. Nice house! I like the way you display your pictures on the wall.', '2020-10-29 22:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
