(7678250, 1255529, 179608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GolferDDS:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks like a beautifully serene place. I will be interested to see where it is. I like the way the dock adds interest to the scene. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The place is near Malcesine, lake of Garda, Italy. Thanks for comment<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by GolferDDS: Looks like a beautifully serene place. I will be interested to see where it is. I like the way the dock adds interest to the scene.  The place is near Malcesine, lake of Garda, Italy. Thanks for comment', '2020-10-30 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
